@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Successful outbox publishes
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.publish?tag=result:success

### Failed outbox publishes
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.publish?tag=result:failed

### Pending outbox events
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:pending

### Published outbox events
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:published

### Dead outbox events
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/outbox.events?tag=status:dead
